# On-device speech model weights (m23-n1). ~1.5 GB of CoreML `.mlmodelc`
# bundles + a HuggingFace tokenizer, copied in from a local source — NEVER
# committed. Root-anchored so it can only ever match the one directory
# `WhisperModelLocation.relativeModelsPath` names; scripts/bundle.sh (m23-n3)
# copies that same directory inside the codesign seal.
/Models/
# HuggingFace snapshot bookkeeping that rides along next to a copied
# tokenizer (`tokenizer/.cache/huggingface`). Belt-and-braces: the copy step
# already excludes it, this makes staging it impossible.
**/.cache/huggingface/
